--------

DOSFS, Alarm, !Printers, the printer driver modules and the printer
definitions are Copyright 1996 Acorn Computers Ltd and are distributed
under the Apache License 2.0. DOSFS's module header and default boot
sector, !System and !Scrap, the builds, and this ReadMe were written for ArcLibre, also under
the Apache License 2.0. Alarm's Code file is generated by running the
original AlarmSrc, and its !RunImage is compacted by the ArcLibre BASIC
squish tool; !Printers' BASIC is built from its pinned sources with the C
preprocessor and the ROM's own BASIC. The sources and full notices are in
the ArcLibre source archive (src/DOSFS, src/Alarm, src/PDriver,
src/PDModules, src/PDumperSpt, src/PDumpers, src/PrinterManager,
src/PrintDefs, src/MakePSFont, src/ArcLibre, LICENSING.md).
